<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107804" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερπηδ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leap over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς δρυφάκτους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					675
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ποταμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Ind.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>overleap,</i> in various senses, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>escape from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοῦ . . πληγὴν οὐχ ὑ. βροτός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					961
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>overstep, transgress,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμιμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					23.73
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.12
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				200
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>surpass,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τῷ μηχανήματι τοὺς σύμπαντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					677e
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				6.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> abs.,
				<i>pass over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1027b6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> of a roller,
				<i>skip</i> a point, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mech.</u>
				855b26
			</span></i>; so, <i>pass over, omit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκόντα ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					59.80
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.</u>
				925.1
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
